# The book's cross-reference signatures are cut from a fixed-width character
# window (bookkit.signature), so a CRLF -> LF conversion shifts every one of
# them at once. It surfaces as a single baffling 'unclassified mention' error
# rather than as a line-ending problem. Pin the working-tree endings so that a
# checkout on any machine matches the signatures committed in MANUAL_REFS.
grimoire.html       text eol=crlf
grimoire-book.html  text eol=crlf

# The editions are archives and images. Never let git treat them as text.
*.pdf   binary
*.epub  binary
